      "sha256": "7342ed8f3cde845e04c98a2188fd317a1cd047fec3ee2e711d4398239e0bc409",
      "determination": "Count the City of Kigali once as a municipal receiving-system account, with its three districts inside the named boundary. Karenge in Rwamagana and wider transport connections are external dependencies, not additional city territory. Nduba facilities, wetlands and RUMI are service examples rather than new project identities in this group. No prior counted place or historical acquisition docket is reused."
    }
  ],
  "review_checks": [
    "Identity screening found no retained counted Kigali or acquisition docket. One City of Kigali place account covers Gasabo, Kicukiro and Nyarugenge. Its districts and service examples add no projects or extra places; external water dependencies do not expand the city boundary.",
    "The exact-version article contains 642 body words, six sections and five chronology events. Five source-bound sections and one labelled editorial evidence test connect city responsibilities, water, mobility, waste and wetlands.",
    "Seven primary English HTML bodies or scoped segments inspected November 22. Codex author/AI self-review is not independent subject review. The overview's undated economic and population headline figures are not imported.",
    "Karenge construction progress is the November 13 issuer account; May 2025 retains month precision and 2027 remains a future completion target. Design production capacity is not delivered household supply or metered continuous operation.",
    "The named Kigali supply areas retain actual shortages. Karenge's Rwamagana location is an external dependency. Rwamagana interview price examples are not reassigned to Kigali residents.",
    "RUMI financing approval is distinct from completed infrastructure. The 2030 terminal passenger estimate remains a forecast. Potential economic displacement and wetland risks are attributed to the city's project description, not invented findings of actual harm or completed remedy.",
    "Nduba pilot inauguration and equipment ratings do not establish city-wide recovery performance. The June 19 date is explicitly the dated implementer account; later video-upload dates are not substituted for that event.",
    "The waste-study HTML summary retains sampling and moisture caveats. Its May 29, 2025 publication is not invented as the collection period, and the linked report, charts and numerical extrapolations are not imported.",
    "REMA's restoration account is undated and approaching completion. Reported ecosystem functions and benefits are not final acceptance or a quantified storm-protection standard.",
    "Unavailable announcement indexes, discovery-only PDFs, videos and unopened attachments are excluded from the article's source set. No forms, accounts, maps, trips, customer-service actions or stopped browser automation were used.",
    "Original eligibility records, all prior named groups, translations and evidence receipts remain exact historical inputs. Coverage targets are unchanged; eligibility is not certification that every older dossier is content-complete.",
    "Source validation, production acceptance, exact owner release, publication, launch and thirty real operating days remain separate gates."
  ],
